# Allowlist. The Dockerfile only ever COPYs entrypoint.sh and asterisk/*, so
# everything else is excluded: the build context stays a few KB, and editing
# the README or compose file can never invalidate a build-cache layer.
*

!entrypoint.sh
!asterisk/

# ...but never ship a rendered config or a stray secret even if one appears
# in asterisk/.
asterisk/pjsip.conf
**/.sip_password
